<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banco de Galicia cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banco de Galicia cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities analyst Brent Erensel cut his rating for Argentina's Banco de Galicia to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- In a report, Erensel said Galicia's stock had risen recently on rumors HSBC Holdings Plc would buy the company.  HSBC has denied the rumor.</p>
<p>-- &quot;BGALY stock has achieved our recently increased price target of $32 and is likely due for a rest,&quot; he wrote.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts fell 21/64 to 30-43/64.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
